          <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
          <p class="post-meta">Last updated {{ lastUpdated }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>This policy explains what personal information {{ site.name }} ("we", "us") collects through {{ site.url | replace("https://", "") }}, why we collect it, and the choices you have. We keep collection to what we need to run this website and respond to you.</p>

          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>{{ site.name }} is a U.S. registered company with an engineering team in Pune, India. For any privacy question or request, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Privacy%20request">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <h3>Information you give us</h3>
          <p>When you use our contact form or email us, we receive your name, work email, company, the topic you choose and your message. We use this only to reply to you, discuss a possible engagement and keep a record of our correspondence.</p>

          <h3>Analytics, only with your consent</h3>
          <p>If you accept analytics cookies, we use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors use the site, such as which pages are viewed, how visitors arrive and roughly where they are (country or city). Google Analytics does not log or store IP addresses. We do not use this information to identify you, and we do not use advertising or remarketing features.</p>
          <p>If you decline, Google Analytics is not loaded and no analytics cookies are set.</p>

          <h3>Server logs</h3>
          <p>Our hosting provider records standard technical information, such as IP address, browser type and the pages requested, to deliver the site and protect it from abuse.</p>

          <h2>Cookies</h2>
          <p>We use no cookies unless you accept analytics. Your choice itself is remembered in your browser's local storage, not in a cookie.</p>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table>
              <thead>
                <tr><th>Name</th><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Expires</th></tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td><code>_ga</code></td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Distinguishes visitors</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
                <tr><td><code>_ga_&lt;ID&gt;</code></td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Keeps session state</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p>You can change your choice at any time using <button type="button" class="link-button" data-consent-open>Cookie settings</button>, which is also linked in the footer of every page.</p>

          <h2>Legal basis</h2>
          <p>Where data protection laws such as the GDPR or UK GDPR apply, we process contact details on the basis of our legitimate interest in responding to your enquiry, or to take steps toward a contract at your request. We process analytics data only on the basis of your consent, which you can withdraw at any time.</p>

          <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
          <p>We do not sell or rent personal information, and we do not share it for advertising. We use a small number of service providers who process data on our behalf:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Netlify</strong>: hosts this website and receives contact form submissions.</li>
            <li><strong>Google</strong>: provides Google Analytics, if you consent.</li>
            <li><strong>Our email provider</strong>: delivers and stores our correspondence with you.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We may also disclose information if required by law.</p>

          <h2>International transfers</h2>
          <p>Our service providers and team operate in the United States and India, so your information may be processed outside your country. Where required, we rely on appropriate safeguards such as standard contractual clauses.</p>

          <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Enquiries and correspondence: for as long as needed to respond and manage any resulting relationship, and no longer than 3 years after our last contact, unless we need to keep it longer by law.</li>
            <li>Analytics data: 14 months, after which Google Analytics deletes it automatically.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Your rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete your personal information, object to or restrict how we use it, receive a copy of it, and withdraw consent. California residents have the right to know, delete and correct personal information, and to not be discriminated against for exercising these rights. We do not sell or share personal information as those terms are defined under California law.</p>
          <p>To make a request, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Privacy%20request">{{ site.email }}</a>. We will respond within the time required by law. You may also complain to your local data protection authority.</p>

          <h2>Security</h2>
          <p>The site is served over HTTPS, and access to enquiries is limited to the people who need it. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, but we take reasonable steps to protect your information.</p>

          <h2>Children</h2>
          <p>This website is intended for business users and is not directed to children under 16. We do not knowingly collect their personal information.</p>

          <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
        </div>
